    oa:note "\"This world joined the Keter Dominion in 4800.\" Not present in the header's already-dated list, though the article is filed under Keter Dominion. 'This world' may refer specifically to the Keterist gas giant Jjrrerrrerr/Annabel rather than the whole Ivonya-Ngia system; see doubts. 'This world', which the reader notes may be the gas giant Jjrrerrrerr rather than the whole system." ;
